The heights is a list of 0, 3, 2, and 1.
The last is the last position of heights.
The crest is 0.
Repeat while crest is less than last and item crest of heights is less than item (crest plus 1) of heights.
Add 1 to crest.

The base is crest.
Repeat while base is less than last and item base of heights is more than item (base plus 1) of heights.
Add 1 to base.

If crest is more than 0 and crest is less than last and base is last, show true, otherwise show false.
